,{v}_{3}\\}$ is linearly dependent.\n\nTherefore, the correct answer is \"I  and III only.\"" 13194139534796 17592186045417 true] [17592186436344 1058 #edb/ref 17592186436346 13194139534796 17592186045417 true] [17592186436344 1062 #uuid "98ee88b4-255d-5371-b8e0-162d265834c2" 13194139534796 17592186045417 true] [17592186436344 1063 #edb/ref 17592186125158 13194139534796 17592186045417 true] [17592186436345 1058 #edb/ref 17592186436344 13194139534796 17592186045417 true] [17592186436345 1062 #uuid "9d79c407-300a-5da0-9c75-089eb5699154" 13194139534796 17592186045417 true] [17592186436345 1063 #edb/ref 17592186323710 13194139534796 17592186045417 true] [17592186436346 1058 #edb/ref 17592186436348 13194139534796 17592186045417 true] [17592186436346 1062 #uuid "b5b9a7fa-e051-59df-bbd8-0b8a8d0cf9f0" 13194139534796 17592186045417 true] [17592186436346 1063 #edb/ref 17592186360493 13194139534796 17592186045417 true] [17592186436347 1062 #uuid "d901e099-6169-5f97-b6dc-6f12105dc206" 13194139534796 17592186045417 true] [17592186436347 1063 #edb/ref 17592186373540 13194139534796 17592186045417 true] [17592186436348 1058 #edb/ref 17592186436347 13194139534796 17592186045417 true] [17592186436348 1062 #uuid "e675a607-0a69-5ca6-abd1-e513d4e378de" 13194139534796 17592186045417 true] [17592186436348 1063 #edb/ref 17592186436343 13194139534796 17592186045417 true]] :edb/tempids {"activity-7d29a223-5e23-57f4-8b66-7a18999e96f6" 17592186436336 "answer-1fdc232f-db34-5cf9-a686-1d8aca3b9396" 17592186436337 "answer-208fee3e-0b02-50d9-98d8-2e23662c759e" 17592186436338 "answer-6a4d26c4-40c5-50a9-b71b-8b677ce7ad91" 17592186436339 "answer-6d8a6441-96ae-5945-99d1-b64f15d9acd5" 17592186436340 "answer-78421f09-e87f-51c5-8b34-2d35c3b091b8" 17592186436341 "answer-field-81fb17ab-9d92-5133-9b83-605ee50e698b" 17592186436342 "question-8366d224-f20d-5615-aa2b-700c64d6cb9f" 17592186436343 "step-98ee88b4-255d-5371-b8e0-162d265834c2" 17592186436344 "step-9d79c407-300a-5da0-9c75-089eb5699154" 17592186436345 